                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "** Abandoned and Unfinished **\n\nThe publisher has abandoned this game, saying that it is too expensive to finish and they do not have time to go any further with it. Instead, they are focused on another new game, and want everyone to instead purchase it.\n\nThis publisher has abandoned this game, but yet still charge full price to new gamers and rake in the profits, not intending to finish this game. They are very apologetic about not being able to finish this game, yet leave it up on the store at full price for more and more people to buy. If they game is dead, remove it, stop scamming people into buying your product that you have thrown out.\n\nGreat start to this game, really loved it and have been waiting for a long while for them to finish it. But it seems all they are focused on is money, not the fan base. Avoid this publisher and do not support them, they sure dont support the fans, and only want your money.",
